format session-log-v1
stamp 20260703.120000
editor fixture
model fixture
voice Kyri
title delta -- a prior-day log carrying no sprig
prompt fold a dated name whose stamp runs straight into its extension
think The session-logs law makes the sprig optional, so this basename is a dated artifact.
obs Requiring the underscore at character 15 left 237 such logs unfoldable (REDS %180).
recommend keep-going the fold moves this file and repoints its index link
